The files in this directory are the Ascend 950 QuantLightningIndexer V1 device
implementation and the LightningIndexer and LightningIndexerV2 headers it includes.
Their paths below this directory match the source repository's attention/ tree.

Source: https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer
