Two internal C++ identifiers in lightning_indexer_v2_topk_base.h and
lightning_indexer_v2_vector1_base.h use the local names IndexType and allOnes.
The source copyright and license notices are preserved.

The local quant_lightning_indexer_service_vector_arch35.h can retain a final
Q=1 index row in the producing vector core for the AVSG epilogue.

The local quant_lightning_indexer_kernel_arch35.h can shard decode score tiles
across cube groups before running the original full-row top-k.
